BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Free Neuropathy Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260812T190000
UID:9bc4be19f9c4c068ea6941de26e658bd@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a FREE Neuropathy Workshop on Wednesday\, August 1
 2th at 6:00 PM at our West Caldwell office. You'll learn about the common 
 causes of neuropathy\, why symptoms like numbness\, tingling\, burning\, a
 nd balance problems occur\, and the treatment options that may help you fi
 nd lasting relief. Please RSVP via email connect@totalrecoverypt.com or ca
 ll 973-221-5601
URL:https://business.northessexchamber.com/events/details/free-neuropathy-
 workshop
X-SOURCE:North Essex Chamber of Commerce
